00:04:07,620 --> 00:04:08,500
Language Takeaway.

61
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:17,920
Okay, well, the aliens are using a lot of language to describe some of the negative results that are happening because of the humans' behavior on Earth, right?

62
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:18,240
Right.

63
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:25,080
And so one of the things they said was that your intelligence and creativity does not come without consequence.

64
00:04:26,130 --> 00:04:26,360
Consequence.

65
00:04:27,130 --> 00:04:27,840
Without consequence.

66
00:04:28,970 --> 00:04:29,130
