84
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:16,920
Okay.

85
00:05:16,980 --> 00:05:17,760
So downfall.

86
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,380
Downfall.

87
00:05:19,380 --> 00:05:21,140
