Or for example, the loss of his dog caused him great anguish.

134
00:07:13,980 --> 00:07:14,340
Okay.

135
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,600
So anguish.

136
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:16,600
Alright.

137
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:19,080
