We're going to look at three phrases that we heard in the dialogue and see how we can use them in different contexts.

142
00:07:35,450 --> 00:07:41,870
So the aliens were praising some of the masterpieces that the humans have created, right?

143
00:07:42,290 --> 00:07:42,530
Right.

144
00:07:43,150 --> 00:07:50,070
He said, you humans create such wonders as the Taj Mahal, blah, blah, blah.

145
00:07:50,310 --> 00:07:50,730
Okay.

146
00:07:51,130 --> 00:07:54,090
So let's look at this phrase, such wonders as.

147
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,320
Alright.

148
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:57,390
So we have a noun here, a wonder.

149
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,600
An amazing thing.

150
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,250
An amazing structure.

151
00:08:00,760 --> 00:08:01,760
Yes.

152
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:03,230
He says such wonders as.

153
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:06,960
Now we can change this noun and replace it with another one, right?

154
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:07,960
Yeah.

155
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:09,170
We can replace that noun with anything.

156
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:10,810
